{
  "description": "P4 full-vector random wavelength-label permutation ablation -- band assignment manifest for all 3 draws. Unlike P2 (within-group permutation), P4 shuffles the entire band vector with no group boundary respected. Generated by rejection-sampled derangement (np.random.default_rng(seed).permutation(n) resampled until no fixed point). 'mapping': {band: source_band} means that band's channel position now receives the wavelength/proj_idx label that source_band originally had. Covers MADOS, m-Cashew-Plantation/m-SA-Crop-Type (S2), and m-Forestnet (Landsat-8-aliased, 6 bands, own full shuffle).",
  "seeds": {
    "1": 101,
    "2": 202,
    "3": 303,
    "twelve_band_seed_offset": 5000,
    "mforestnet_seed_offset": 9000
  },
